<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Online Learning Platform</title>
    <style>
        *{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        body{
            background:#f4f4f4;
        }
        header{
            background:#007bff;
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            padding:20px;
        }
        .container{
            display:flex;
            flex-wrap:wrap;
            justify-content:center;
            gap:20px;
            padding:20px;
        }
        .course-card{
            background:white;
            width:300px;
            border-radius:10px;
            overflow:hidden;
            box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .course-card img{
            width:100%;
            height:180px;
        }
        .content{
            padding:15px;
        }
        h3{
            color:#007bff;
            margin-bottom:10px;
        }
        .progress{
            background:#ddd;
            border-radius:20px;
            overflow:hidden;
            margin:10px 0;
        }
        .progress-bar{
            background:green;
            height:15px;
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            font-size:12px;
        }
        button{
            background:#007bff;
            color:white;
            border:none;
            padding:10px 15px;
            border-radius:5px;
            cursor:pointer;
        }
        button:hover{
            background:#0056b3;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <h1>Online Learning Platform</h1>
</header>
<div class="container">
    <div class="course-card">
        <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcStR-tk2ivrdcWu1YVY3t86P2-hDRJh0lzJQh820eHFgg&s=10" alt="Course">
        <div class="content">
            <h3>Web Development</h3>
            <p><b>Category:</b> Programming</p>
            <p><b>Instructor:</b> John Smith</p>
            <p>Learn HTML, CSS and JavaScript from basics.</p>
            <p><b>Objective:</b> Build responsive websites.</p>
            <div class="progress">
                <div class="progress-bar" style="width:70%;">70%</div>
            </div>
            <button>Enroll Now</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="course-card">
        <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRw_F5x06-HsF19stHV9MCOu_Vf22H4nGWa7meIH0oI6A&s=10" alt="Course">
        <div class="content">
            <h3>Python Programming</h3>
            <p><b>Category:</b> Coding</p>
            <p><b>Instructor:</b> Sarah Lee</p>
            <p>Learn Python for AI and software development.</p>
            <p><b>Objective:</b> Create real-world applications.</p>
            <div class="progress">
                <div class="progress-bar" style="width:50%;">50%</div>
            </div>
            <button>Enroll Now</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="course-card">
        <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTCnLjEH14WOJHxaFm8iDRuY7dyJhBzKFgWNxYw4ZOuLw&s=10" alt="Course">
        <div class="content">
            <h3>Data Science</h3>
            <p><b>Category:</b> Analytics</p>
            <p><b>Instructor:</b> David Miller</p>
            <p>Analyze and visualize data effectively.</p>
            <p><b>Objective:</b> Become a Data Analyst.</p>
            <div class="progress">
                <div class="progress-bar" style="width:85%;">85%</div>
            </div>
            <button>Enroll Now</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>